ses extra.</span></td><td data-option="glean"><strong>€270–584k</strong><span>+ vendor quote; no verified public list price in the prior research.</span></td><td data-option="benchling" hidden><strong>€270–604k</strong><span>+ platform / AI / usage quote and any migration.</span></td><td data-option="haystack" hidden><strong>€520k–1.13m</strong><span>Staff €480k–1.01m + infrastructure / API €40–120k.</span></td><td data-option="custom"><strong>€920k–1.88m</strong><span>Staff €840k–1.68m + infrastructure / API €80–200k.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Internal team</th><td data-option="copilot" hidden>2–3 FTE<span>+ services / usage</span></td><td data-option="glean">2–3 FTE<span>+ services</span></td><td data-option="benchling" hidden>2–3 FTE<span>+ integration</span></td><td data-option="haystack" hidden>4–6 FTE<span>Backend / platform, data integration, retrieval / evaluation, product; fractional security / UX.</span></td><td data-option="custom">7–10 FTE<span>Hybrid capabilities plus frontend, QA and reliability.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Value & trade-off</th><td data-option="copilot" hidden>Existing office ecosystem.<span>Lab-source integration and permissions need proof.</span></td><td data-option="glean">Broad, permissions-aware retrieval.<span>Scientific parsing and source freshness need proof.</span></td><td data-option="benchling" hidden>Lab-native workflows.<span>External-source coverage and migration may dominate.</span></td><td data-option="haystack" hidden>More control over retrieval and evaluation.<span>We own connectors, access enforcement and operations.</span></td><td data-option="custom">Most workflow control.<span>Highest engineering burden; slowest fit to current capabilities.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Decision gate</th><td data-option="copilot" hidden>Demonstrate ELN/LIMS coverage and access controls on our tasks.</td><td data-option="glean">Connect our lab systems and verify answers against the same evidence set.</td><td data-option="benchling" hidden>Prove useful coverage within and beyond Benchling; price migration.</td><td data-option="haystack" hidden>Show a vendor gap worth owning and secure senior engineering capacity.</td><td data-option="custom">Prove a repeatable need beyond vendor capabilities and fund long-term ownership.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="business-scroll-hint">Select more options above; scroll across when needed. Costs include different exclusions—check the cost basis below.</p><div class="business-verdict"><strong>My business-case starting point</strong><p>Test an existing-estate vendor against improved search first. Choose a hybrid or custom build only when a demonstrated gap justifies the ownership cost.</p></div>
<details class="lab-more"><summary>Cost basis, exclusions and source dates</summary><p>Illustrative planning ranges, not supplier quotes or market averages. Loaded staff cost: €120–168k per FTE-year, including allocated internal time. Vendor-route totals include internal staff and the services / integration allowances in the original case. Year-two staffing may remain similar.</p><p>Figures exclude VAT, major data remediation and whole-platform replacement. Buy options exclude unquoted vendor fees and any listed extras; totals are therefore incomplete. USD and EUR are intentionally separate, with no currency conversion assumed. Training a foundation model is excluded.</p><p>Product documentation and pricing were checked in the prior case research on 28 October 2026; they have not been revalidated for this layout change. Vendor capabilities are claims to test. Obtain comparable quotes and validate integrations before a funding decision.</p></details>
</article><article class="lab-slide" aria-label="5 of 7">
<p class="lab-step">Value & reuse</p><h2 class="dilemma__title">Time back today.<br>A head start tomorrow?</h2>
<p class="scenario-caption">Illustrative scenarios · assumptions to test</p>
<div class="value-callout"><span>Working scenario · annual capacity</span><strong>~17,000 hours</strong><p>600 scientists × 46 weeks × 60% adoption × 1 net hour/week</p></div>
<figure class="scenario-chart line-chart">
