<div class="reuse-estimate"><strong>Research milestone</strong><span class="reuse-estimate__gain">0–2 weeks earlier</span><div class="reuse-endpoints"><span>Baseline <b>24w</b></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Critical path* <b>22–23w</b></span></div><div class="reuse-scale" role="img" aria-label="Research milestone: 24 weeks baseline; 22 to 23 weeks if preparation is on the critical path, otherwise no gain, on a zero to 24 week scale."><span class="reuse-band" style="left:91.67%;width:4.16%"></span><i style="left:100%"></i></div><div class="reuse-axis"><span>0</span><span>24 weeks</span></div></div>
